@startuml AI Integration Flow
title AI Integration Sequence

actor User
participant LWC as "Any UI Component"
participant Controller as "AIController"
participant Service as "AIService"
participant Einstein as "Einstein AI Platform"
participant Database as "Salesforce DB"

== Product Recommendations ==
User -> LWC: Browse products
LWC -> Controller: getProductRecommendations(userId, category)
Controller -> Service: analyzeUserBehavior(userId)

Service -> Database: SELECT OrderHistory__c, ViewedProducts__c
Database --> Service: User behavior data
Service -> Einstein: Predict product recommendations
Einstein --> Service: AI recommendations

Service -> Database: SELECT recommended Product__c
Database --> Service: Product details
Service --> Controller: RecommendationResponse
Controller --> LWC: Recommended products
LWC --> User: Show recommendations

== Quote Scoring ==
User -> LWC: Generate quote
LWC -> Service: scoreQuoteAcceptance(quoteData)
Service -> Einstein: Analyze quote factors
note right: Factors: discount %, products, customer history,\nindustry, deal size, negotiation status

Einstein --> Service: Acceptance probability + reasoning
Service -> Database: UPDATE TALEXO_Quote__c SET AcceptanceProbability__c, AIReason__c
Database --> Service: Updated

Service --> LWC: Score + insights
LWC --> User: Show AI insights

== Combo Package Suggestions ==
User -> LWC: View combo packages
LWC -> Service: getAISuggestedPackages(userProfile)
Service -> Database: SELECT user Order__c, Product__c preferences
Database --> Service: User data

Service -> Einstein: Suggest optimal combo packages
note right: Based on: purchase history, budget,\nproduct categories, discount preferences

Einstein --> Service: Package recommendations
Service --> LWC: AI suggestions
LWC --> User: Highlight recommended packages

== Predictive Analytics ==
Service -> Database: SELECT sales data, trends
Database --> Service: Historical data
Service -> Einstein: Predict future demand
Einstein --> Service: Demand forecasts

Service -> Database: UPDATE Product__c SET PredictedDemand__c
Service -> Admin: Send forecast reports
@enduml